paragraph_text:
PNWGnmnc *bokiz ‘inscribed billets’ (vel sim.; ON baekr, OHG buoh, both ‘books’;
OF, OS bék have been remodelled) > *boeci ‘books’ > North. OE bac, WS béc;
PNWGmce *brokiz ‘leggings’ (ON broekr, OHG bruoh) > *breeci > OE bréc (OF brek);

